Async Alembic environment.

The database URL is read from the application settings in env.py, not from
alembic.ini. Run migrations through the Makefile so they execute inside the api
container, against the same environment the application uses:

    make migrate                  # alembic upgrade head
    make revision m="add x"       # autogenerate a new revision

Every autogenerated revision must be read before it is accepted: autogenerate
does not detect renames, added enum values, or most constraint changes.
